If they have kids, if they have a dog, if they have anxiety, if they like people are so open on Twitter.

565
00:56:46,800 --> 00:56:47,840
So keep an eye out.

566
00:56:48,320 --> 00:56:50,480
And if you see something interesting, say something.

567
00:56:50,800 --> 00:56:53,760
Even if you have no news, just say something like, hey, I read your thing on that.

568
00:56:53,920 --> 00:56:54,560
It was awesome.

569
00:56:55,040 --> 00:56:56,160
It really touched me in this way.

